# A knot is a definition, and asking whether two definitions are equal is
# asking whether two formulas are the same formula. Equality refuses it, the
# way it already refuses a function or an effect.
#
# The refusal fires on RE-ENTRY, not on meeting a cell: an ordinary lazy
# operand is forced and compared as its value. Only arriving twice at the same
# pair of cells says the cycle closes through one.
x = [x]

y = [y]

pub play = print "{x == y}"
